  "name": "crates_llms_txt",
  "description": "A multi-language toolchain designed to transform Rust crate documentation into structured formats optimized for Large Language Model consumption. It orchestrates asynchronous retrieval from docs.rs using zstd decompression and local documentation synthesis via rustdoc-json extraction. The project implements a robust compatibility layer to handle evolving rustdoc schemas and provides native Node.js integration through NAPI-RS bindings.",
